<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (SoloFarmacias is a web platform developed to centralize and simplify the comparison of medicine prices, discounts, and benefits offered by Chilean pharmacies, particularly for Caja Los Andes members. The project was implemented using web technologies such as Next.js, Supabase, and Tailwind CSS, integrating real-time data extraction and filtering functions. Through this system, users can search for medications by price, discount, and location, and receive automated notifications when prices drop or new offers appear. The results demonstrate a significant reduction in search time and improved user access to reliable, updated information. In conclusion, SoloFarmacias enhances transparency, promotes informed decision-making, and contributes to more efficient and equitable access to pharmaceutical products.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
